 "description": "MXR Dyna Comp (1972) as ElectroSmash's analysis draws it: an input buffer, a CA3080 OTA whose gain follows its bias current, a phase splitter, and an envelope detector that turns the bias current down as the signal gets louder; Sensitivity sets how much, Output the level. The supply's C10 and C11 are as ElectroSmash draws them (it says the original may not have had them).",
 "tags": [
  "compressor"
 ],
